Hi Lauren and Patricia,

Robert and I agreed this morning to carry 24 and 48 h into the next cycle of =
the medium-exchange study. The June 26 repeat (MX-250626) had ten readings pe=
r interval. The 24 and 48 h groups were within the 15.0% CV criterion, and th=
e 72 h group was still at 21.0% after matching prep dates. I've attached the =
decision we issued today.

Please plan around 24 and 48 h and leave the measurement dates open. We'll se=
t those separately. Keep the 72 h records with both June rounds, including th=
e ten repeat readings we used for the decision and the ten initial readings w=
e kept for comparison.

Thanks,
Melissa

